<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TestCaseEntity>
   <description>Confirmed live 9/18/2026: the new UI enforces the PO Box rule ("P.O. Box addresses are not allowed") the same as the old UI. RETESTED 9/24/2026: the 9/18 "no disallowed-character validation" note was stale — it likely never blurred the field before checking. With a real blur after typing, aria-invalid correctly flips to "true" for "123 Main St!", so New UI does validate this after all. Not a bug. Max-length (Old UI caps at 50) is still undocumented on New UI, not yet asserted. See TC_Registration_AddressFormat_OldUI for the full old UI comparison.</description>
   <name>TC_Registration_AddressFormat</name>
